WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.920
Method of Completing Samayik.

00:02.280 --> 00:05.840
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu Javanijjae
Nisihiae,

00:05.840 --> 00:07.080
Matthaena Vandami.

00:07.400 --> 00:09.240
like this after Khamsaman

00:09.400 --> 00:10.600
like before

00:10.760 --> 00:13.960
receit Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari, Annattha sutra

00:14.240 --> 00:16.160
chant 1 Logassa (untill Chandesu Nimmalayara)

00:16.160 --> 00:16.960
If you don't know,

00:16.960 --> 00:19.120
then chant four Navkar Mantras in Kausagg Mudra

00:21.800 --> 00:24.040
then say Namo Arihantanam

00:24.320 --> 00:25.640
then recite Logassa

00:25.800 --> 00:27.520
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:27.720 --> 00:31.240
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

00:31.240 --> 00:32.840
Matthaena Vandami.

00:36.840 --> 00:39.160
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

00:39.160 --> 00:42.080
Samayik Muhapatti Padilehu? Ichcham.

00:42.080 --> 00:42.800
having said this,

00:42.800 --> 00:44.840
recite Muhaptti ke 50 bol

00:56.640 --> 00:58.600
Then, by giving a Khamasamana,

00:58.600 --> 01:02.360
Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

01:02.360 --> 01:03.480
Matthaena Vandami.

01:07.040 --> 01:09.200
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

01:09.200 --> 01:11.480
Samayik Paru? Yathshakti

01:11.480 --> 01:13.440
Then, by giving a Kamasamana,

01:13.440 --> 01:16.960
then, Icchami Khamasamano Vandiu
Javanijjae Nisihiae,

01:16.960 --> 01:18.360
Matthaena Vandami.

01:23.280 --> 01:25.400
Ichchakaren Sandish Bhagwan

01:25.400 --> 01:27.360
Samayik Paryu? Tahati

01:27.360 --> 01:28.080
After saying this,

01:28.080 --> 01:31.120
place your right hand on the
Charwala or Asan,

01:31.120 --> 01:32.800
bow your head,

01:32.800 --> 01:34.320
and recite 1 Navkar Mantra

01:34.320 --> 01:36.120
then recite Samaiya Vayajutto

01:36.520 --> 01:38.800
Then, facing the Sthapnacharyaji,

01:38.800 --> 01:40.520
hold your right hand reversed

01:40.520 --> 01:42.720
palm facing towards our face

01:42.720 --> 01:43.920
recite 1 Navkar Mantra
